{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 在 S09 把原本开放的疑问收窄成了“怕孤单到连受过的气也肯再受”，推断稍显过头；S13 个别表述也不够自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的话语切分和重点加亮，让观众不必读完整段落就能抓住人物每一阶段的念头变化，而且前因后果衔接得比较清楚。感受词不仅有情绪，还能通过身体反应、声音质感、动作和音乐变化呈现情绪如何发生、转折和消退，尤其是标注到时出现的内容，能让观众边听边获得具体体验。X 的双栏结构也有优点，但右侧不少感受词更像并列的情绪标签，缺少 Y 那种随音乐展开的细腻层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "17242999-d2e1-4ace-b318-9d901331fd04", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T194924761444Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:50:28.054783+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3fda28805e768ecfc4f4d949c262fc5b1075e00d9e143793d726edc1c54c3d10", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g